.TH dalgona-dev-journal 1  "dalgona-dev-journal " 
.SH NAME
dalgona\-dev\-journal \- Replay, diff, and edit session journals.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdalgona dev journal\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Replay, diff, and edit session journals.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
dalgona\-dev\-journal\-replay(1)
Fold a journal and print the recovered state.
.TP
dalgona\-dev\-journal\-diff(1)
Print the folded fields that differ between two journals.
.TP
dalgona\-dev\-journal\-torn(1)
Copy a journal with its tail cut mid\-record.
.TP
dalgona\-dev\-journal\-sidecar(1)
List or dump the sidecar files in a session directory.
.TP
dalgona\-dev\-journal\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
